description=Small fixes and finishing touches for vanilla. Cold packs and coolers work: chill a cold pack in a fridge (half way) or a freezer (fully), or leave it out below freezing, then put it in a cooler. The cooler keeps food as cold as a fridge does, about 6 hours for each frozen pack (a sandbox setting), and the packs and the cooler show how cold they are in their names. Washing clothes by hand no longer gets them spotless: without soap blood and dirt only come down to 40%, with soap to 20%, and only a washing machine gets them fully clean (both floors are sandbox settings). Also, when Item Rarity UI is active, modded items get a rarity colour worked out from the loot lists the same way Item Rarity UI does it for vanilla. Singleplayer only for now.
